{"term": {"label": "愛", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-i", "title": "盡心上", "description": "孟子曰：「盡其心者，知其性也。知其性，則知天矣。存其心，養其性，所以事天也。殀壽不貳，修身以俟之，所以立命也。」\n孟子曰：「莫非命也，順受其正。是故知命者，不立乎巖牆之下。盡其道而死者，正命也。桎梏死者，非正命也。」\n孟子曰：「求則得之，舍則失之，是求有益於得也，求在我者也。求之有道，得之有命，是求無益於得也，求在外者", "occurrences": 9, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "務", "id": "務"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "善", "id": "善"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "愛", "variants": [], "id": "愛"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "教", "id": "敎"}, {"form": "敬", "id": "敬"}, {"form": "日", "id": "日"}, {"form": "時", "id": "時"}, {"form": "正", "id": "正"}, {"form": "歸", "id": "歸"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "水火", "id": "水火"}, {"form": "求", "id": "求"}, {"form": "物", "id": "物"}, {"form": "知", "id": "知"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "親", "id": "親"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}, {"form": "賢", "id": "賢"}, {"form": "長", "id": "長"}, {"form": "食", "id": "食"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.7611600264161584, "source": "政", "target": "善"}, {"weight": 2.451005098112319, "source": "政", "target": "敎"}, {"weight": 2.114532861491106, "source": "政", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 2.5199979695992702, "source": "務", "target": "親"}, {"weight": 2.6741486494265287, "source": "務", "target": "賢"}, {"weight": 1.900958761193047, "source": "務", "target": "知"}, {"weight": 2.7611600264161584, "source": "日", "target": "善"}, {"weight": 2.114532861491106, "source": "日", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 3.079613757534693, "source": "時", "target": "食"}, {"weight": 2.386466576974748, "source": "物", "target": "正"}, {"weight": 1.2878542883066382, "source": "物", "target": "君子"}, {"weight": 1.13370360847938, "source": "物", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.6933193964148026, "source": "物", "target": "愛"}, {"weight": 0.7282385003712155, "source": "物", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 1.20781